{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Day of the Shell is a fast-paced tactical roguelite, where each turn is played in a single click. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gods have brought down their wrath on humanity, and only a few remote islands remain. A lonely monster huntress has risen to challenge and appease the gods, traveling through what's left of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/extras/a18d6b768c2e67931300c128651e4135.poster.avif?t=1751302878\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/extras/a18d6b768c2e67931300c128651e4135.webp?t=1751302878\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One Click, One Turn: Tactical choices are made with <strong>a single click</strong>, making gameplay simple and dynamic while maintaining strategic depth. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Islands: Survive against monsters and collect treasures on each island to open its portal. Will you be able <strong>to reach the heart of the Islands</strong> and destroy the Shell? <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/extras/d2488506337bcc55a2e36aa13e7064b5.poster.avif?t=1751302878\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/extras/d2488506337bcc55a2e36aa13e7064b5.webp?t=1751302878\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape Your Destiny: Combine the powers of the many <strong>Warden's blessings</strong> to fight your enemies. Different variations and combinations will allow you to create a unique playstyle for each game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is Part of the Adventure: With each death, you return to your home island, where you can <strong>permanently upgrade</strong> or consider your strategy for the next day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/extras/b1111901a3bced038d5b7970d912d527.poster.avif?t=1751302878\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/extras/b1111901a3bced038d5b7970d912d527.webp?t=1751302878\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3008340?t=1751302878","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3008340?t=1751302878","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751302878","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751302878","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3132920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Day of the Shell is a fast-paced tactical roguelite, where each turn is played in a single click. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gods have brought down their wrath on humanity, and only a few remote islands remain. A lonely monster huntress has risen to challenge and appease the gods, traveling through what's left of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/extras/a18d6b768c2e67931300c128651e4135.poster.avif?t=1751302878\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/extras/a18d6b768c2e67931300c128651e4135.webp?t=1751302878\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One Click, One Turn: Tactical choices are made with <strong>a single click</strong>, making gameplay simple and dynamic while maintaining strategic depth. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Islands: Survive against monsters and collect treasures on each island to open its portal. Will you be able <strong>to reach the heart of the Islands</strong> and destroy the Shell? <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/extras/d2488506337bcc55a2e36aa13e7064b5.poster.avif?t=1751302878\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008340/extras/d2488506337bcc55a2e36aa13e7064b5.webp?t=1751302878\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape Your Destiny: Combine the powers of the many <strong>Warden's blessings</strong> to fight your enemies. Different variations and combinations will allow you to create a unique playstyle for each game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is Part of the Adventure: With each death, you return to your home island, where you can <strong>permanently upgrade</strong> or consider your strategy for the next day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=